  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\nWELCOME TO\n\n\n# Santa Monica’s Best in Oral Surgery\n\n\n\n# Santa Monica’s Best in Oral Surgery\n\n\nContact Us\n\nEST\n\n1974\n\n50 Years of Oral Surgery Care\n\nVisit our oral surgery practice in mid-city Santa Monica.\n\nWith 50 years of experience, we specialize in various oral health treatments, from reconstructive to orthognathic surgery.\n\nVisit our oral surgery practice in mid-city Santa Monica. With 50 years of experience, we specialize in various oral health treatments, from reconstructive to orthognathic surgery.\n\nLearn more\n\n\n## Why Choose Us\n\n\n\n## Why Choose Us\n\n\n\n###### Expert Surgeons\n\n\nHighly qualified and experienced oral surgeons.\n\n\n###### Advanced Technology\n\n\nState-of-the-art equipment and techniques.\n\n\n###### Patient-Centered\n\n\nCompassionate and personalized care.\n\n\n###### Comprehensive Services\n\n\nWide range of oral and maxillofacial procedures.\n\n\n###### Dental Implant\n\n\nKevin Wong\n\n\n###### Dental Implant\n\n\n\n###### Dental Implant\n\n\n\n###### Dental Implants\n\n\nSherry Redfern\n\n\n###### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n#### What our patients are saying\n\n\n\n### What our patients are saying\n\n\n\n### What our patients are saying\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\nMark Suponitsky\n\nIncredibly positive experience! A day after 3 extractions- no pain, no bleeding and very minimal swelling. Dr Tanner was highly professional, very engaging and most importantly he clearly does excellent work( he came highly referred)! Monique, Antia and Jackie were a great supporting cast- professional, friendly and efficient. The facility itself is stunning! I highly recommend this facility and Dr Tanner!!\n\nSuzy Richman\n\nDr Ting explained everything he was doing and always made sure I was feeling okay. He is gentle and kind with a great “bedside manner”. Also the staff working with him was competent and kind. A well run team. I have had LOTS of oral surgery and Dr Ting and the Center are among the best. Have been here twice for tooth/implant extractions and bone grafts and will be back for implants. A bit pricey but worth it.\n\n\n##### L\n\n\nLori Flores\n\nSuper friendly staff. Made me feel at ease for my minor procedure. The energy there is amazing. Which is much needed when you are walking in there extremely nervous. Procedure was done quickly. Best part is they talk you through it all. And I loved the support that Brianna and Liz gave me when the awesome doc was numbing me (hate that party the most!)\n\n\n##### P\n\n\nPamela Williams\n\nI am extremely fortunate to have been referred to Dr. Richard Ting. Not only is he gentle, patient and kind, he is a very skillful surgeon. I've had two surgeries, both of which went extremely well. I found all of his staff, medical and clerical, to be very friendly and professional. Jackie and Johnny were exceptional. The office environment is very lovely and calming.\n\n\n##### J\n\n\nJessica Shusko\n\nDr. Ting and staff were incredible. I was referred to Dr. Ting by my dentist to have a wisdom tooth removed. I was able to schedule an appointment within the week and do the consultation and removal in the same day. Dr. Ting was incredibly thorough during the consultation and his entire staff was friendly, thoughtful and mirrored Dr. Tings thoroughness. I hardly had any bleeding or swelling and didn’t need any pain medication after. I can not express enough how painless and smooth this process was.\n\n\n##### W\n\n\nW Bauer\n\nThe entire staff was fabulous. Made me very comfortable and calmed me down before the extraction. Dr Park was amazing and the office was very modern. I would highly recommend this practice if you need any procedures\n\n\n##### N\n\n\nNivita Aldrete-Brito\n\nFrom the moment you walk in the staff greets you before you walk up to the counter. The wait is minimal but it's a spectacular view! Dr. Tanner is super professional and very sweet. I came 5 years ago and he remembered my case! Impressive!\n\nWendy Mullin\n\nDr. Tanner was very knowledgeable and patient in answering all my concerns. The whole team includes Dr. Tanner, Rosa and Ryan was wonderful in helping me to feel less nervous about my tooth extraction. Thank you for your professional service!\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n##### M\n\n\n\n##### L\n\n\n\n##### P\n\n\n\n##### J\n\n\n\n##### W\n\n\n\n##### N\n\n\n\n### Meet our Team\n\n\n\n### Meet our Team\n\n\nWe are very proud of the excellent care we provide our patients. Get to know our team of surgeons.\n\nLearn More\n\n\n### Park\n\n\n\n### Ting\n\n\n\n### Ivry\n\n\n\n### Tanner\n\n\n\n### Vajda\n\n\n\n### Schwartz\n\n\n\n### Oral Surgery Procedures\n\n\nWe offer a wide range of oral and maxillofacial surgery services, including jaw surgery, wisdom tooth removal, facial pain treatment, TMJ disorder diagnosis, dental implants, and bone grafting.\n\n\n###### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n###### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n###### Wisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n\n###### Wisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n\n###### Sinus Lift\n\n\n\n###### Sinus Lift\n\n\n\n###### Teeth-In-One-Hour\n\n\n\n###### Teeth-In-One-Hour\n\n\n\n###### All-on-Four Dental Implants\n\n\n\n###### All-on-Four Dental Implants\n\n\n\n###### Facial Trama\n\n\n\n###### Facial Trama\n\n\n\n###### Sedation Dentistry\n\n\n\n###### Sedation Dentistry\n\n\n\n###### Orthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\n\n\n###### Orthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\n\n\n###### View All\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n## Transform Your Smile Today\n\n\nExperience the Difference of Our Innovative Dental Procedures\n\n\n### Transform Your Smile Today\n\n\n\n### FAQ\n\n\nWhat services does Beverly Hills Center for Oral Surgery offer?\n\nHow much do dental implants cost in Beverly Hills?\n\nAre Beverly Hills oral surgeons known for their expertise with celebrities and public figures?\n\nDo you offer emergency oral surgery services in Beverly Hills?\n\nHow long do dental implants last in Beverly Hills?\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
